ached evidence table. The output must help us decide the data contract, quara=
ntine rule and backfill requirement.

Data available: monthly account snapshots, status events, limits, product enr=
olments and signatories; monthly customer and KYC snapshots; transaction-leve=
l timestamps, channels, amounts, statuses and error context; the latest close=
d loan files available by the request date, including affordability, pricing =
